    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With TYRANIDS as your Army Faction, you may use Shadow in the Warp once each battle. Use it during the Command phase of either player’s turn. One of your units with the ability must be on the battlefield. Require a Battle-shock test from every enemy unit. Apply −1 if an enemy is within 6″ of a friendly SYNAPSE unit.",
